From c3ec79e34462fd656415b5723b697037a19f7ced Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 09:06:03 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: Reloaded ability data (power, PP cost, effects, new
 abilities)

Ported by scripts/port-reloaded-tables.py from the Golden Sun Reloaded v1.83a rebalance (forum.goldensunhacking.net topic 2779); the credit is in the table's header. The effect ids the data uses beyond the stock names are ARENA_EFFECT_* in arena_config.h.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 games/tbs/include/arena_config.h   |   16 +
 games/tbs/src/game/ability_table.c | 1126 +++++++++++++++-------------
 2 files changed, 627 insertions(+), 515 deletions(-)

diff --git a/games/tbs/include/arena_config.h b/games/tbs/include/arena_config.h
index 2a739b49d2..1544cfb9ae 100644
--- a/games/tbs/include/arena_config.h
+++ b/games/tbs/include/arena_config.h
@@ -107,4 +107,20 @@ static inline int ArenaRules_ReviveHp(int hpMax, int power, int stockHp) {
 #define ARENA_LINK4 1
 #endif
 
+/// Effect ids (AbilityDefinition.effect, the weakness lists) that the Reloaded
+/// data uses beyond the stock names; ARENA_RULES_EFFECT_IDS gives each its
+/// handler and its own odds (battle/ability.c). Ids 8, 12 and 16 (stock Dull,
+/// Impair and Weaken) now run the one-stage handlers, and 21, 22 and 30 (Confuse,
+/// Charm, Reflect) borrow Delude's, Paralyze's and Haunt's; the stock names
+/// ABILITY_EFFECT_ATTACK_DOWN_2 and so on still say what the number is called in
+/// the English game. These ids have no stock name that fits:
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_DULL_2 36    ///< two-stage Attack down, as the old Dull
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_IMPAIR_2 37  ///< two-stage Defense down
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_WEAKEN_2 38  ///< two-stage Resistance down
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_TAINT 39     ///< Taint (Poison's handler) with its own odds
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_POISON 40    ///< Poison (the venom handler)
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_PARALYZE_2 41 ///< Paralyze's handler, a second set of odds
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_HAUNT_2 43   ///< Haunt's handler, a second set of odds
+#define ARENA_EFFECT_CONDEMN_2 54 ///< Condemn's handler, a second set of odds
+
 #endif
